{"unit_id":"Aegink__dsh-channel-qq#card-zh","repo":"Aegink/dsh-channel-qq","commit":"942663ec69f299163d1d23af405e44a1abd92261","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-channel-qq 是把 QQ 群聊和私聊接入 DSH 的 OneBot v11 渠道插件。它以 cordis 服务装入 DSH，通过 OneBot 协议端收发消息，并将消息交给 DSH agent 处理。插件还提供 QQ 工具、聊天记忆与知识库检索、技能触发、定时主动消息和管理面板，适合需要在 QQ 中运行 DSH 助手或管理群聊互动的场景。部署需要 Node.js 22+、DSH 宿主和 OneBot v11 协议端，并在配置中提供连接地址及访问令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.ts:83-101","src/features/platform/index.ts:20-44","src/features/memory/index.ts:1-14","src/features/kb/index.ts:1-9","cordis.patch.yml:8-17"]}
